      {
        "id": 403,
        "title": "a thought about how the games are packaged",
        "body": "A thought about how the games are packaged, since there are a lot of them now and the space is finite: would loading them separately work better than baking every one into the image? Then a person keeps the four they play and the rest never costs them anything, and somebody who writes their own has somewhere to put it. I have no idea how hard that is on this chip, so treat it as a question rather than a request.\n\nSeparately I have been running my own build on a different board with two games I wrote for it. Happy to send them your way if that is useful, equally happy not to.",
